---
const techInterests = [
  'Jenkins',
  'Grafana',
  'Prometheus',
  'Linux',
  'Docker',
  'Open Source',
];
---

<section id="about" class="py-20 bg-gray-200">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
    <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-center mb-12 text-purple-900 tracking-tight">About Me</h2>
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        <!-- Education Card -->
        <div class="bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-lg shadow-md border border-gray-100 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center mb-4">
              <i class="fas fa-graduation-cap text-3xl mr-4 text-purple-900"></i>
              <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-purple-900">
                Education
              </h3>
            </div>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
              Technician in Computer Science and Informatics with a solid
              foundation in system fundamentals and software architecture. 
              Started my journey with a simple React JS/TS bootcamp (i know), then fell in love with technology with FOSS, 
              backend and playing with infra to finally arrive to mobile development (currently kotlin obsessed).
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Linux Experience Card -->
        <div class="bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-lg shadow-md border border-gray-100 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center mb-4">
              <i class="fab fa-linux text-3xl mr-4 text-purple-900"></i>
              <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-purple-900">
                Linux Experience
              </h3>
            </div>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
              2 years working intensively with Linux systems, automation, and
              server administration and contributing to maintaining Linux packages for multiple distros. 
              Almost a year of experience administrating server environments and deploys with custom Ansible playbooks. 
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Technical Interests Card (Full Width) -->
        <div class="bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-lg shadow-md border border-gray-100 md:col-span-2">
          <div class="flex items-center mb-4">
            <i class="fas fa-network-wired text-3xl mr-4 text-purple-900"></i>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-purple-900">
              Technical Interests
            </h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
            Passionate about distributed systems, scalable architectures,
            and observability. Experience with monitoring tools, CI/CD,
            DevOps infrastructure for Linux systems. Experience developing mobile and fullstack projects (that I use 
            in my daily life and for others).  
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            {techInterests.map((interest) => (
              <span class="bg-blue-100 text-blue-800 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm font-medium">
                {interest}
              </span>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

